  "reading": "Three in four mid-turn route deflections begin straight after a previous deflection on both maps: route steering re-asserts its heading for a frame or two and the guard fires again, so the episode count measures flicker within one encounter. Waypoint handoffs start under 1 per cent of them on the lab map and 4.5 per cent on dm4. Encounters start most often from steady routed running (30 per cent on the lab map, 44 on dm4), then from resuming after combat (lab) or a noise (dm4).",
